age?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fdigirobotics%2Fpartners%2Fzerodev.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"marketplace\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\"><div class=\"reveal \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--primary)] sm:text-[13px]\">02 / Training data marketplace</p><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl font-heading text-[clamp(2.45rem,5vw,5.4rem)] font-medium leading-[.94] tracking-[-.045em] text-[var(--foreground)] mt-5\">5.4 Billion Smartphones. One New Way to Earn.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[19px] leading-[1.5] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] lg:text-[21px]\">Embodied AI needs enormous amounts of audio-visual data to make robots useful. This marketplace gives both creators and robotics builders access to the quality egocentric data embodied AI requires.</p><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[19px] leading-[1.5] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] lg:text-[21px]\">Enter the marketplace and let our AI agent secure stablecoin payments while it supervises the preview of first-person task data — built for perception, planning, manipulation, and embodied AI research.</p></div><div class=\"absolute -left-[9999px] top-0 z-[-1] flex flex-nowrap gap-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">All</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Domestic/Hospitality</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Industrial</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Manufacturing</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Hazardous</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Logistics</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Assembling</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Healthcare</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Agriculture</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Construction</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Urban work</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Hardware</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Maritime</button><button data-tab-measure=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium\">Entertainment</button><button data-tab-more=\"true\" class=\"min-h-11 shrink-0 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-white/70 border-white/15 flex items-center gap-2\">More <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"